    isbefore: []  # 7c34
    duplicate_of: []  # 7c34
    not_duplicate_of: []  # 7c34
    pr_ref:  # 7c34
    description: "FOUND 2026-09-24 while writing WI-mapor's pascal fixture. A method implemented as `procedure TA.Run; begin ... end;` emits NO symbol, so every call in its body is lost.\n\nRepro: a.pas with `type TA = class procedure Run; end;` and an implementation `procedure TA.Run; begin One(); end;`. analyze_pascal emits symbols for program P and the top-level procedures only. No TA.Run symbol, and no calls edge from its body. Top-level overloads anchor correctly (WI-mapor's fixture, pinned).\n\nThis is the ordinary Delphi/FreePascal method shape (a class declaration plus a qualified implementation), so on any object-pascal codebase most calls are likely missing. Not measured: there is no pascal repo in whole_bunch_of_repos.\n\nASKED: emit a method symbol for a qualified defProc (name TA.Run, owner TA). Then check that _find_enclosing_function's position-built id matches it."  # 7c34
    fields: {}  # 7c34
- op: discuss  # f328
  at: '2026-10-04T22:59:12Z'  # f328
  by: agent  # f328
  actor: jgstern_agent  # f328
  clock: 2  # f328
  nonce: f328  # f328
  message: "Branch jgstern-agent/fix/darik (worktree ~/hg_wt/darik, based on the stage-8 integration branch 2a98abb55d). Commits 80ecd183ca (core: edge_source + shared c_family walk), 97cd5f2a8c (pascal methods + nested procedures), 5aa2eb9066 (pascal: a call shape in a declaration is a typecast). NOT merged, no status change.\n\nWhat changed: a qualified defProc (procedure TA.Run, constructor/destructor/class function/class operator TA.X) is kind=method named TA.Run; every call edge is drawn from the innermost defProc found by POSITION (symbols_at over file_symbols()), else the program/unit, else the file anchor. A bare call inside a method reaches its own class first (ta.get), as Pascal's Self lookup does.\n\nLive repro (the filed one): before -- symbols P, One only, no edge. After -- symbols P, One, TA.Run (method), TA.Get; calls 12 TA.Run -> One and 17 TA.Get -> One, src resolves.\n\nMeasured on sherpa-onnx's Pascal API (62 files; ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/decontend/run_10032026/darik/{base,after2}.pascal.sherpa-onnx.json): symbols 135 -> 254 (134 methods), definitions with no symbol 119 -> 0, call edges 163 -> 810, dangling src 0 -> 0. 342 call sites sat in method bodies.\n\nResiduals filed: WI-gufip-suviv-tufil-sarun-huhif-vituv-hatub-zovor (receiver calls, external FFI routines, class types, typecasts in code)."  # f328
